              "width": 1000,
              "content": "Sells the craft. Scroll pulls one screen at a time: the blank tee prints in four passes (underbase, orange, teal, bone) while the separations list ticks from QUEUED to PULLED. We don't just draw the graphic, we prep it for the press.",
