              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Under the shirts, four cards of different weights replace dos and don'ts. FULL-SERVICE leads (orange) because it's the reason to hire WestCose. PRINT METHOD merges screen print and DTF with a live toggle. BLANKS shows economy to premium sourcing. MOCKUPS: any garment, before you print.",
