          "y": 1804,
          "name": "Concept 1 rationale",
          "fill": "#b7b3a7",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1380,
          "content": "A clear choice of destination: the Designs portfolio on this site, the Labs website for website design and development, and the Shop website for WestCose merchandise.",
