          "y": 1680,
          "name": "Concept 2 motion explanation",
          "fill": "#d0cdc2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1380,
          "content": "The line connecting sketch, refinement, and production extends off the page. It lifts into depth as an orbital path; the finished W becomes the core.",
