              "content": "Three landing-page directions for the brand identity and logo design service, built from the homepage system: Oswald display, Manrope body, mono kickers, signal-orange actions, tinted liquid glass and real portfolio marks. Each section has a motion note that maps it to a scroll chapter or motion component that already exists, so most of each page can be built from code that already ships.",
