                              "content": "Prints fall through the frame on a scroll-scrubbed timeline, each with its own flutter, depth blur and shadow distance. Far sheets are smaller and softer. The headline holds still while its lines reveal. The closest print passes the camera, and its paper wipes into the warm canvas of the next chapter."
