                              "content": "TOUCHPOINT SWAP"
                            },
                            "UISeQ": {
                              "content": "While pinned, scroll steps through the five touchpoints, and the tabs also work as direct controls. Each swap uses the apparel mixer's print-pass transition, and the placement guide redraws around the artwork. FRONT/BACK flips the tee in place, and the glass spec panel updates for each surface."
                            },
                            "h2KBO": {
                              "content": "5 steps · pass 520ms · flip 600ms cinematic"
                            },
                            "s3ShWS": {
                              "content": "↳ apparel-mixer.tsx · apparel-scene-motion.tsx · glass-panel.tsx"
                            }
                          }
