                              "content": "SCOPE ORBITS"
                            },
                            "UISeQ": {
                              "content": "The rings draw outward from the W (mark, then identity, then system), and each ring's deliverable nodes pop on as it completes. Hovering a destination card lights its ring and dims the others, and hovering a ring highlights its card. Cards use the shared destination-card hover lift."
                            },
